SUMMARY:Deadline: Voices With Impact: Film Production Grant 2027 (Sanctuary
 )
DESCRIPTION:Voices With Impact funds transformative five-minute short films
  about mental health\, awarding USD 7\,500 per filmmaking team. The 2027 t
 heme is Sanctuary\, explored through the lens of mental health: a sanctuar
 y can be a place\, a person\, a practice\, a memory\, or something else. B
 eyond the grant\, selected teams receive regular production meetings and s
 tory consultations\, industry mentor connections\, feedback from mental he
 alth professionals\, festival strategy development\, and distribution thro
 ugh Art Opening Minds' festival and a network of 350+ educational partners
  that integrate the films into curricula. Films must be exactly five minut
 es. TIMELINE: grants awarded late October 2026\, production from November\
 , deliverables due mid-April 2027\, world premiere at the Voices With Impa
 ct festival in early June 2027. No application fee. Deadline: 14 September
  2026\, midnight.\n\nOrganisation: Voices With Impact / Art Opening Minds\
 nLocation: International (distribution focus in North America)\nAward: USD
  7\,500 production grant per filmmaking team\nDuration: Production from No
 vember 2026\, deliverables due mid-April 2027\, world premiere early June 
 2027\n\nMore: https://artopeningminds.org/voices-with-impact?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://artopeningminds.org/voices-with-impact?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:International (distribution focus in North America)
END:VEVENT
