SUMMARY:Deadline: First Flights Short Film Fund (Autumn 2026 Round)
DESCRIPTION:First Flights funds emerging filmmakers worldwide making live a
 ction and documentary shorts in any scripted genre (scripts up to 30 pages
 ). The autumn 2026 round awards up to GBP 7\,000 / USD 10\,000 in cash tow
 ard production costs\, plus two Kodak awards of five 400ft rolls of 16mm f
 ilm stock with complete processing\, and one USD 10\,000 post-production p
 ackage from Periscope. Selected filmmakers also receive festival submissio
 n assistance and distribution opportunities through partner organizations.
  APPLY with project details\, logline\, synopsis\, director's vision state
 ment\, completed script\, director biography\, budget and lookbook (sizzle
  reel optional)\; independent judges score originality\, creativity\, plot
 \, pacing\, characters\, entertainment and message\, with interviews for l
 ong-listed candidates. Production must begin within six months of the dead
 line. ENTRY FEE: tiered\, GBP 30 until 30 September or GBP 40 until the fi
 nal 31 October 2026 deadline.\n\nOrganisation: First Flights Media Limited
 \, with Kodak and Periscope\nLocation: UK-based fund\, open to filmmakers 
 worldwide\nAward: Up to GBP 7\,000 / USD 10\,000 cash toward production\; 
 plus two Kodak awards of 5 x 400ft rolls of 16mm stock with full processin
 g\, and one USD 10\,000 Periscope post-production package\nDuration: Produ
 ction must begin within six months of the application deadline\n\nMore: ht
 tps://www.first-flights.com/short-film-fund/?utm_source=artificialnouveaug
 rantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.first-flights.com/short-film-fund/?utm_source=artificialnou
 veaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:UK-based fund\, open to filmmakers worldwide
